# DS-0002 applies to .clusterfuzzlite/Dockerfile, which is a CI-only OSS-Fuzz
# builder image. ClusterFuzzLite mounts /github/workspace/build-out as a
# root-owned volume and its build harness writes libFuzzer artifacts before
# invoking the project build script, so forcing a non-root USER breaks fuzz CI.
# Revisit by 2026-10-31 or when ClusterFuzzLite supports non-root build output.
DS-0002
